  "finding": "This second diagnostic passes delivery and does not reproduce the first trial's 14.96% baseline loss. Of 24064 primary packets in its unshaped baseline, all reach Docker VM eth0 egress; 38 (0.1579%) are absent at VM eth0 ingress; every packet observed at VM ingress reaches the browser namespace. This localizes the small observed loss to the path outside the VM, including macOS Docker networking and the external route/relay. It does not locate or establish the cause of the first trial's larger loss.",
